# render-card demo — the default theme (zigzag).
name: render-demo
title: SemText in one file
description: |
  One SemText document reads three ways: a styled page in the browser,
  a structural record for an agent, and plain text in a terminal.

  The card is a small YAML header plus prose — `render-card` frames it
  and wraps the body to the frame. Recolor it with
  `render-card --theme double demos/render-demo.card`, or narrow the
  frame with `--width 40`.
